# Player-facing changelog

When the user asks for a **player-facing changelog**, **Steam changelog**, **Workshop update notes**, or similar:

## Do this

1. Identify **each mod touched** by the work.
2. Write **`<ModFolder>/About/changelog.txt`** as **Steam Workshop BBCode**.
3. Keep detail in **`CHANGELOG.md`**; optional root `CHANGELOG.md` highlight.
4. **Post to Discord** — **one webhook message per mod** as a **rich embed** (not plain `content`). Read URL from `.local/discord-changelog-webhook.url` (gitignored). Never commit the token.

## Steam (`About/changelog.txt`)

```
[h1]ModName — Update[/h1]
[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Lead[/b] — player language.
[/list]
```

## Discord embed (match this layout)

Each POST body:

```json
{
  "embeds": [{
    "title": "ModName — Update",
    "color": 9109504,
    "thumbnail": { "url": "https://azraelgodking.github.io/rimworld_mods/img/<Preview>.png" },
    "description": "**__Changes__**\n• …\n\n**__Download__**\n• **Steam Workshop:** <url>\n• **GitHub Release:** zip in release assets\n• **Manual:** folder → `RimWorld/Mods/`"
  }]
}
```

- **Title:** mod display name + ` — Update` (do **not** invent version bumps unless the user asked / About was versioned).
- **Color:** maroon sidebar `9109504` (`#8B1A2B`).
- **Thumbnail:** public docs preview PNG on GitHub Pages (`…/img/StrataPreview.png`, `HomesteaderPreview.png`, `NemesisPreview.png`, `DeepColonyPreview.png`, `DateNightPreview.png`, `StormproofPreview.png`). Skip thumbnail if none exists.
- **`**__Changes__**`:** convert Steam bullets to `•` lines (same facts, Discord markdown).
- **`**__Download__**`:** Steam Workshop link from `About/PublishedFileId.txt` when present; always GitHub `releases/latest/download/<ZipName>.zip` note as “zip in release assets”; Manual = extract into `` `RimWorld/Mods/` ``.
- One embed per message; ~600ms between posts.

## Do not

- Plain-text Discord posts when this embed layout is required
- Bundle multiple mods into one message
- Commit webhook URLs
- Bump About versions just for Discord titles

## After writing

Deploy to RimWorld - Dev Mods when the user asks (include `About/changelog.txt`).
